<title>JAPAN: Fukutome Meat - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fukutome Meat - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 17.10		vs	   18.21</p>
<p> Operating    loss 79    million	  vs   loss 170    million</p>
<p> Current	loss 74    million	  vs   loss 223    million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 99    million	  vs   loss 255    million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 5.85 yen	  vs    loss 15.06 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     17 million	  vs	  17 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Fukutome Meat Packers Ltd is a meat processor and ham producer.</p>
</text>
